// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2044676794" "Goodbye, {HeroName}! Another time, perhaps!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3974103131" "Your combat abilities are... more potent than my data implied. I suppose that's what I get for trusting the historians."
// Script Variable SaysList :
