// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1271542179" "<f random:player><t 4>Halt, who approaches? I gave express orders that no one was to disturb...<t 3>You... you are not of my legion. Who are you?<t 0>A party to Romulus's plot, no doubt. Your treachery ends here!"
