// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3243729202" "We would never have found this cavern, had we not been first guided to it. Perhaps we were destined to receive its power... or perhaps, someone is manipulating the gifts of the gods to their own ends. Whatever the reason, I know that it is no longer here.<em>You fought valiantly, warrior. I wish you fortune in your quest."

