// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1063257132" "You spoke with Imperious, but appear to be no closer to finding Pandora's Box."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P414446780" "You're back. Did  you find anything good? No?<br><br><color orange>Harriman breathes a sigh of relief.</color><br><br>That means you're done with the whole time exploration gig then, right? I gotta say, I'm kind of glad. A lot of the stuff you're up to, it's a little over my head, you know? I mean, I like to work in the here and now. It's what I'm used to.<br><br>Speaking of which, while you were off playing Time Cadet, I've been working on scrounging up some leads. I may have found one..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OdysseusTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P2529676921" "<color orange>Odysseus struggles to catch his breath.</color><br><br>You got me, {HeroName}. Good show. Now, if you don't mind, please tell me why you've decided to crash my little side-business. I'm sure we can come to some sort of arrangement."
// Answer Text :
"P2875346166" "Pandora's Box, Odysseus. Heard of it?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1489023607" "<color orange>Odysseus manages a grin at the mention of Pandora's Box.</color><br><br>Heard of it? {HeroName}, I'd be surprised if there's a Villain in the Isles that <b><i>hasn't</b></i> heard about Pandora's Box. Everywhere you look, some chump with a scrap of power starts glowing yellow and becomes the Next Big Thing.<br><br>I've already diverted significant resources towards tracking down the artifact, and I was just preparing to pursue one of my leads."
// Answer Text :
"P4208047440" "And that lead would be...?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2689670181" "Oh, you'd love the answer to that one, wouldn't you? Forbidden artifacts are my specialty, {HeroName}, and Pandora's Box is the Grand Prize. I'm not just going to give up the chase that easily."
// Answer Text :
"P878097957" "Who said you'd have to? I'm talking long-term here, Odysseus."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P1919892581" "<color orange>Odysseus furrows his brow in suspicion.</color><br><br>What are you proposing, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P1867392977" "That we combine resources. Or do you want Arachnos to find the Box first?"
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P836790270" "That... is a fair point, {HeroName}. I shall consider your proposal.<br><br><color orange>You hand Odysseus one of Lastri's business cards. Odysseus claims it with a raised eyebrow.</color><br><br>Interesting. You've become rather organized, {HeroName}. I'll contact your assistant and negotiate terms. If we can come to an agreement, then you'll have my network at your disposal, as well as the support of my Warriors.<br><br><color orange>Odysseus stands, pocketing the card.</color><br><br>This may prove to be a profitable arrangement after all. Still... next time, call, will you? I would prefer to negotiate contracts with a little less damage to my property."
// Answer Text :
"P476882564" "Fair enough, Odysseus. I'll speak with you later."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1366693065" "So, this Pandora's Box thing. Ancient, possibly magical artifact, really powerful, everyone wants it. Totally not my specialty. I do guns. <i>But</i>... I think I found someone who can help.<br><br>See, there's a guy who works with this kind of stuff. Goes all over the world, picking up magical trinkets wherever he can find them. The more powerful or famous it is, the more he's interested in it.<br><br>Thing is, this guy usually operates around Paragon. Makes sense, cause that place is filled with all sorts of kooky magic stuff and so that's where he'd want to be most of the time. But I've got a source that says he's paying a visit to the Isles this week, and after a bit of searching I think I've got an address for you.<br><br>So, how about it? You interested?"
// AcceptString :
"P665027073" "I'm interested. Who is this guy?"
// SendOffString :
"P746483942" "Guy's name is Odysseus. Yeah, I know, weird name, right? Runs an outfit out of Paragon called the Fighters or the Barbarians or something. Anyway, my info has him managing shipments from a warehouse not far from here.<br><br>Keep your guard up when you go in, {HeroName}. This guy may be a magic-lovin' kook but he's tough, and he probably won't be happy to see you."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1580884444" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Professional Advice</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4183141444" "Interrogate Odysseus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3530125039" "This Odysseus character isn't going to be here forever. You need to get moving if you want to catch him in the Isles."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3516327971" "This is the location Harriman indicated. It looks like Odysseus is moving some pretty high-grade merchandise through here."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - OnEnterObjectiveComplete 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P951089390" "Speak with Odysseus"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P942436319" "Odysseus"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2794826164" "<t 3><em cellphone>No, cancel next week's auction. I'll be working on acquisitions for the rest of the month.<t 0><em cellphone>One moment. I think I may need to put you on hold..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2625983136" "{HeroName}! To what do I owe the pleasure of this visit?"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4120114898" "I suppose this is a territorial thing, yes? Am I on your 'turf'?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2492850303" "Or is it personal? I didn't sell you anything malicious, did I?"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1227537074" "I don't normally... do refunds..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1186592023" "ALRIGHT, I yield! Just... tell me what you're here for!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3230421403" "If you don't mind, please tell me why you've decided to crash my little side-business. I'm sure we can come to some sort of arrangement."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3444754734" "{HeroName}, I'd be surprised if there's a Villain in the Isles that HASN'T heard about Pandora's Box. I've already diverted significant resources towards tracking it down, and I was just preparing to pursue one of my leads."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3983566147" "What are you proposing, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3657093290" "Interesting. You've become rather organized, {HeroName}. I'll contact your assistant and negotiate terms. If we can come to an agreement, then you'll have my network at your disposal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - BossKilled 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P967863585" "Find Odysseus"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1505004117" "You have defeated Odysseus. Time to learn what he knows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4281256421" "You've negotiated an alliance with Odysseus and his Warriors, and may have gotten a crucial lead on Pandora's Box."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P982102346" "Hey, boss. Just got a call from Lastri. Said you convinced this Odysseus character to sign on, and wanted me to tell you that the paperwork's all been settled.<br><br>I gotta say, you can be convincing when you want to be. I figured you'd pound some info out of the guy - I never expected this to be a recruitment op. Anyway, Lastri sent along some info you're going to want to hear..."
// RandomFameString :
"P3222628656" "Hey, that's {HeroName}. I hear {Hero.gender=male he|she}'s hiring for some big project."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - StudentTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P2419672444" "<color orange>Fear and hope flash across the student's face as he tries to gauge whether or not you are a threat. He's clearly not in a stable state of mind.</color><br><br>W-what's going on here? What did that woman want with Professor Harvan?<br><br>This is too freaky. Did you <i>see</i> those guys? Who <i>dresses</i> like that?"
// Answer Text :
"P1540573212" "Get out more, kid. You've never heard of Arachnos?"
// Answer Text :
"P2457160439" "Calm down. I need you to tell me where Dr. Harvan is."
// Answer Text :
"P1110793253" "I'm going to reinstate Nocturne's offer. Info or the arm."
// Page Arachnos Text :
"P2665640186" "<color orange>The student's eyes widen in fear and recognition.</color><br><br>Wait... that wasn't...<br><br>You mean those guys were <b><i>Arachnos</b></i>? Oh, man... oh man! I need to get out of here! This is not good!<br><br>Arachnos is, like, seriously dangerous! We can't be here! We'll <b><i>die</b></i>!"
// Answer Text :
"P2115950160" "I can handle them, kid. Just tell me where Harvan is."
// Page Arachnos2 Text :
"P1002625593" "<color orange>The student seems to calm down a bit, reacting instinctively to your confidence.</color><br><br>Yeah... uh, yeah, Professor Harvan. He's in the deepest section of the cave, he was... he was trying to map out the cavern structure so we could start excavating soon...<br><br><color orange>The student fidgets nervously in front of you.</color><br><br>Can... can I go now? I'd like to, um, leave."
// Answer Text :
"P617642844" "Sure, whatever. We're done here."
// Page Heroic Text :
"P3792955372" "<color orange>The student appears to be under the impression that you are some kind of Hero.</color><br><br>Professor Harvan's deeper in the cavern. He wanted to map out the cavern so that we could start excavating...<br><br>That woman wasn't the only one after him. She had more people with her. Please, you have to help the Professor!"
// Answer Text :
"P2993241125" "Then I suppose I'd better go save him then, shouldn't I?"
// Page Threaten Text :
"P2223784490" "<color orange>The student cringes away from you.</color><br><br>What is WRONG with you people? We're just here on some stupid class assignment!<br><br><color orange>Still cringing, the student points deeper into the cavern.</color><br><br>Professor Harvan's in the back, ok? Please don't hurt me!"
// Answer Text :
"P86929888" "Get lost, kid. I don't want to see you again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HarvanTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P165890982" "<color orange>Doctor Harvan appears to be somewhat flustered, but otherwise unharmed. Arachnos probably wanted him for the same reason you do.</color><br><br>Now see here, young {Hero.gender=male man|lady}! I <i>demand</i> to know what is going on here! We are on a licensed expedition, and if you people think you can intimidate us into-"
// Answer Text :
"P4288174973" "Doctor, Arachnos is looking for you. I'm here to help."
// Answer Text :
"P1821683217" "Quiet, Doctor. You're coming with me."
// Answer Text :
"P97467183" "(Backhand Harvan across the face)"
// Page Helpful Text :
"P2283448039" "<color orange>Harvan's look of indignation turns to momentary doubt.</color><br><br>Did you say... Arachnos? Oh, dear. I suppose I should have seen this coming.<br><br>If they're here for me, then they must be searching for Pandora's Box. You see, I happen to be the foremost researcher in the field of-"
// Answer Text :
"P2176912283" "I know, Doctor. I need to get you out of here."
// Page Helpful2 Text :
"P1822114511" "Oh, oh yes, of course. I'll follow you out.<br><br>Do be careful, young {Hero.gender=male man|lady}. I've heard Arachnos can be quite dangerous."
// Answer Text :
"P3787170552" "You don't say."
// Page Stern Text :
"P2597723311" "<color orange>Harvan puffs up with indignation.</color><br><br>Uncultured brute! I will not submit to your ham-handed attempts at intimidation! I demand to know the name of your employer!"
// Answer Text :
"P3058128939" "I'm self-employed, Harvan. Now march, or I start causing pain."
// Page Stern2 Text :
"P3794614466" "<color orange>Harvan stares at you for a moment, still defiant. A moment later, you see a flicker of doubt, then fear... and Harvan's shoulders slump. Silently, he nods to you."
// Answer Text :
"P4155899572" "Good. Follow me."
// Page Violent Text :
"P1407998626" "<color orange>Harvan reels from the blow. When he recovers, he glares at you angrily.</color><br><br>How DARE you! I'll have you know that I-"
// Answer Text :
"P3481201907" "Don't push me, Harvan. It's in your best interest to obey."
// Answer Text :
"P1170870141" "(Backhand Harvan again)"
// Page Violent2 Text :
"P3963507161" "<color orange>This blow sends Harvan stumbling. He shakes his head roughly, regaining his senses, and starts yelling at you again.</color><br><br>Will you STOP-"
// Answer Text :
"P2454193987" "You really want to go for three?"
// Answer Text :
"P3693990891" "(Time for another backhand)"
// Page Violent3 Text :
"P106511247" "<color orange>The third attack drives Harvan to one knee. He struggles to his feet, and turns his bruised face back up to you.<br><br>He opens his mouth to speak, but thinks better of it. He hangs his head, and shuffles forward to follow you."
// Answer Text :
"P1359979682" "That's better."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LastriTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P3731242328" "Good day, {HeroName}. I hope you didn't mind the interruption. The Mitscher detected Arachnos reinforcements approaching, and Mr. Hill claimed he could sense Ghost Widow's presence nearby. I thought it prudent to send you some of our own resources as well.<br><br>Negotiations with Dr. Harvan are underway. It appears you've made... quite the impression on him."
// Answer Text :
"P521168147" "I should hope so."
// Page HarvanFriendly Text :
"P2542500343" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_James_Harvan width=128 height=128><color orange>Harvan beams at you.</color><br><br>I must say, your assistant has made quite the enticing offer. A charmer, that one.<br><br>I'll say to you what I said to her, {HeroName}. If you have the resources available to enable my research, and you can vouch for my safety, then you'll have my utmost cooperation.<br><br>This may be the best chance I have of completing my life's work. To see the legendary Pandora's Box with my own eyes... why, I can hardly wait to get started! Hah!"
// Answer Text :
"P118353243" "Glad to have you on board."
// Page HarvanHostile Text :
"P1089247521" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_James_Harvan width=128 height=128><color orange>Harvan glares at you.</color><br><br>You know, you could learn a thing or two from your assistant, young {Hero.gender=male man|lady}. What's the phrase again? 'You catch more flies with honey', or something to that effect.<br><br><i>Despite</i> how you have insisted on treating me, I've decided that I'll work with you. As far as I've seen, you're my best shot at seeing Pandora's Box in my lifetime... and I doubt Arachnos would have offered me such generous terms.<br><br><color orange>Dr. Harvan frowns, and breaks eye contact with you.</color><br><br>Besides... I'm sure I don't have much of a choice in the matter anyway..."
// Answer Text :
"P2276678872" "You're a smart man, Dr. Harvan. I'm sure we'll get along fine."
// Page HarvanCowed Text :
"P4015086054" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_James_Harvan width=128 height=128><color orange>Harvan cringes away from you. Angry, purple bruises are beginning to show on his face. After a moment, Harvan finally speaks up.</color><br><br>Y-y-your assistant has assured my personal safety for as long as I cooperate with you. You don't need to hurt me, I'll work for you.<br><br><color orange>Seeing that you haven't moved to attack him, Harvan relaxes slightly.</color><br><br>I... I never thought that my research would garner this sort of attention. I mean... I always thought that the legends of the Box were more accurate than my peers believed, but this...<br><br><color orange>Harvan looks up at you.</color><br><br>The legendary Pandora's Box exists, and the power contained within is sought by all mankind. In the end, that's all you're really after, isn't it?"
// Answer Text :
"P2248532482" "It is, Harvan. And you're going to find it for me."
// Page FinalPage Text :
"P170769879" "I'll make sure Dr. Harvan has the appropriate accommodations. Arachnos apparently has the same information on his career that we do, so it would be safest to keep him aboard the Mitscher for now. I'll forward any pertinent information we obtain to Lieutenant Harriman, for your perusal.<br><br>If there's anything else, sir...?"
// Answer Text :
"P4235715256" "That will be all, Lastri."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P72579003" "So, the lead Odysseus got is this guy named James Harvan. Apparently, he's this world-famous archaeologist. Goes around the world studying ancient ruins and finding old documents, stuff like that.<br><br>Here's the kicker, though: seems that Pandora's Box is the guy's specialty. Harvan's been searching for the Box for his whole life, way before this whole empowerment fiasco. You ask me, a lifetime of failure ain't much of a resume, but if you're looking for an expert on Pandora's Box, he's probably the guy."
// AcceptString :
"P2699670135" "Fantastic. Where can I find him?"
// SendOffString :
"P1567616100" "He's working on some kind of expedition off the coast of Albania. I already spoke with Lastri, and she's arranged transportation for you.<br><br>Word of warning, {HeroName}: Harvan's not just an expert on Pandora's Box, but a <i>well-known</i> expert. That means you might not be the only one looking for him. Just stay alert while you're there, and get him out ASAP. Once you've got him en route to the Mitscher, you should be in the clear."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1972224801" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: High in Demand</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3414251895" "Track down James Harvan"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2551946949" "{HeroName}, let me break this down for you. Right now? We've got some insider info. We know a guy who knows a guy, and we might be able to get some answers. But as soon as word gets out that Harvan's the man that knows Pandora's Box? You can bet he's going to disappear, and <i>fast</i>.<br><br>So, maybe show some hustle on this? That's my recommendation, anyway. You do what you want."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2252274327" "Dr. Harvan is the only one you know of with extensive knowledge of Pandora's Box. He's coming with you, whether he likes it or not."
