"P275502327" "Lastri Kayumanis"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3507512003" "Archaeology Student"
// Script Variable BOSS1_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3858766575" "This young man appears to be working on excavating the ruins in this cave."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P179305603" "<t 2><t 0>Beats me. I've never seen them before."
// Script Variable BOSS2_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2423907643" "This young woman appears to be working on excavating the ruins in this cave."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1146371985" "Do you think they're here for Professor Harvan?"
// Script Variable BOSS_6_DISPLAYNAME :
"P74228687" "BOSS NAME"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1149363348" "That woman gave me the creeps. I think we need to leave. Like, now."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P49495341" "<t 2><t 0>And just abandon the whole project? I don't know..."
// Script Variable PET_NAME :
"P571929767" "Anxious Student"
// Script Variable PET_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4073961583" "W-who are you people? What are you doing here?"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P981451639" "Are... are you a Hero? Did you come to save us?"
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveText :
"P1978178772" "Locate Harvan"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2574285960" "I've got no patience for this, kid. Tell me where Dr. Harvan is, or I take an arm."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1861028723" "{HeroName}! We've got competition, people. Take {Hero.gender=male him|her} down!"
// Script Variable WaveShout :
"P1936714319" "<shout>Stop {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3609192693" "{HeroName}, it's you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P117698205" "This is becoming a problem. I'm calling her in."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P872083568" "W-what's going on here? What did that woman want with Professor Harvan?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1619734360" "You mean those guys were ARACHNOS?!? Oh, man... oh man! I need to get out of here! This is not good!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2046290488" "He's in the deepest section of the cave, he was... he was trying to map out the cavern structure so we could start excavating soon..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1188745044" "Professor Harvan's deeper in the cavern. That woman wasn't the only one after him, she had more people with her. Please, you have to help the Professor!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2558030801" "Professor Harvan's in the back, ok? Please don't hurt me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Nocturne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P627793807" "Arachnos is already here. You need to find Harvan, and quickly."
// Script Variable PET_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2778705265" "This is quite unnecessary! Unhand me!"
// Script Variable SayOnRescue :
"P3228301039" "What is the meaning of all this?"
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P1728863331" "Ah. You're still here."
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P2750894304" "This... this is not good."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3104878687" "<t 2>Just stay put and keep quiet.<t 0>I don't plan on staying here any longer than necessary."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P687183407" "<t 1>Oh, it's {HeroName}. How grand.<t 0>I don't suppose you'll leave quietly?"
// Script Variable WaveShout :
"P631358960" "The target has been compromised. Destroy {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P161411510" "How very bothersome."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2899283177" "Now see here, young {Hero.gender=male man|lady}! I demand to know what is going on here!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P54757168" "Did you say... Arachnos? Oh, dear. I suppose I should have seen this coming."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2147031139" "Oh, oh yes, of course. I'll follow you out. Do be careful, young {Hero.gender=male man|lady}. I've heard Arachnos can be quite dangerous."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P762577228" "Uncultured brute! I will not submit to your ham-handed attempts at intimidation! I demand to know the name of your employer!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P133326000" "How DARE you! I'll have you know that I-"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3409537852" "Will you STOP-"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3148347594" "Ghost Widow"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P224897981" "So. This is why you could not accomplish your tasks."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P990811230" "You did well to summon me, Nocturne. {HeroName} has grown into quite the thorn in our sides."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3498737310" "Yet, {Hero.gender=male he|she} is no match for the three of us. It is time for us to end this farce."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P269446367" "ENOUGH!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1447486153" "You are fools to cross Arachnos so brazenly! Your lives are MINE!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3807639346" "Nocturne"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2143152963" "I'm going to enjoy tearing you to pieces, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P364222750" "What the..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3187534667" "Arbiter Sands"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1748573434" "I wholeheartedly concur. We've spent enough time in this dreadful place."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1576366095" "Captain Castillo"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3091149354" "I am in great agreement, my friend. The addition of ourselves to this struggle is most necessary!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2643409899" "<t=1 caption x=0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Distasteful!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2274476278" "<t=1 caption x=0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Dishonorable!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P482203200" "<t=1 caption x=0.4 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Disgusting!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P831555404" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>To arrange a battle just so... it is inexcusable!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1203744497" "<t=4 caption x=0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><bgcolor sienna><color white>Perhaps we should even the odds a little, eh?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1396194858" "...can guarantee you full funding on all expeditions you deem necessary for this project."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1930511229" "Good day, {HeroName}. I hope you didn't mind the interruption. Negotiations with Dr. Harvan are underway. It appears you've made... quite the impression on him."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3140095688" "I'll make sure Dr. Harvan has the appropriate accommodations. It would be safest to keep him aboard the Mitscher for now. I'll forward any pertinent information we obtain to Lieutenant Harriman, for your perusal."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P481336880" "<t 2><t 0>And you're confident that my personal safety is assured?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1977350123" "If you have the resources available to enable my research, and you can vouch for my safety, then you'll have my utmost cooperation."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3978498746" "Despite how you have insisted on treating me, I've decided that I'll work with you. As far as I've seen, you're my best shot at seeing Pandora's Box in my lifetime... and I doubt Arachnos would have offered me such generous terms."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2046923330" "Y-y-your assistant has assured my personal safety for as long as I cooperate with you. You don't need to hurt me, I'll work for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ProxTrigger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2723758211" "Lieutenant Harriman"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1748070215" "You defeated Arachnos, and escaped with Harvan unharmed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LastriTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2710545866" "Welcome to the lost city of Oranbega, sir. My men will attempt to fortify this position, to ensure that Dr. Harvan is well protected.<br><br>I suggest you confer with him about this artifact he's looking for. I doubt conditions in the rest of the city will be safe enough for him to accompany you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - HarvanTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IsOwner Text :
"P165024869" "<color orange>Harvan is examining the structure of the city carefully.</color><br><br>Amazing... judging by the sediment, I'd say this structure must be thousands of years old... but it clearly wasn't built this far underground, and it has hardly any structural damage...<br><br><color orange>Harvan finally notices you near him, and turns to you with a start.</color><br><br>Oh my! Oh... {HeroName}. I apologize. I find myself quite taken with this place. Simply fascinating."
// Answer Text :
"P3115676985" "We're here for a reason, doctor. The Key...?"
// Page Key Text :
"P1579485989" "Ah, yes, the Key! Well, not strictly a key, per se, but I found that to be the best way to describe it to your mercenary friend. It's really more of a... focus. At least, that's what my father's research implies.<br><br>The object is called the Antikythera. I'm not entirely sure on its history or origins. It could have been created to work in tandem with Pandora's Box, or perhaps it was made afterwards, in order to manipulate it... regardless, it is a tool of incredible potential, and I believe it is integral to locating Pandora's Box."
// Answer Text :
"P1331277986" "So, what am I looking for, exactly?"
// Answer Text :
"P3710975169" "Your... father's research?"
// Page Father Text :
"P2807306417" "<color orange>Harvan nods studiously.</color><br><br>My life has been devoted to finding and studying Pandora's Box, but much of my research is actually based on my father's work. He obsessed over locating the Box, simply to prove its existence. Most of his work was disregarded by his peers, but his research has helped me immensely in my search.<br><br>The only obstacle I've encountered in my studies has been the lack of appropriate funding and manpower to track down the components of my father's work... but thanks to you, that is no longer a problem, now, is it?"
// Page Description Text :
"P3343541843" "The Antikythera's humble appearance belies its potential, {HeroName}. It is small, small enough to carry under one arm, and resembles an ancient measuring device. Which, I suppose, is true, though few know what the Antikythera truly measures.<br><br>You must be careful, {HeroName}. I do not know if the Circle of Thorns know the Antikythera's true purpose, but they are most certainly aware of the power inherent in the device. You will likely find the object to be well-guarded.<br><br>If you can retrieve the device, I can begin using it to locate Pandora's Box. I wish you luck, {HeroName}. In this hunt, our goals are one and the same."
// Answer Text :
"P2509195929" "I'll be back shortly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1458944947" "Okay, boss. I think we're starting to close in, here. Lastri's already pumping Harvan for info, and we got something big.<br><br>Harvan pointed us to something he called, 'The Key'. It's related to Pandora's Box somehow, and Harvan's convinced that if he can get his hands on it, then he can locate Pandora's Box for you. Sweet deal, right?<br><br>There's a catch, though. This key, it's a powerful artifact in its own right, and the Circle of Thorns have their grubby hands all over it. Lastri's in the middle of setting up an excursion to Paragon, and she asked me to send you to the Mitscher as soon as you're ready."
// AcceptString :
"P2940277984" "I'll head out, then."
// SendOffString :
"P155700855" "Right. I'd lend you the support of some of my boys, but... frankly, I'm not sure they'd be much help. Subterranean caverns aren't exactly our strong suit. We're called the <i>Sky</i> Raiders for a reason, you know."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3553233826" "Search Oranbega for The Key"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3248280357" "Lastri's almost finished with her preparations, {HeroName}. As soon as you're ready, the expedition's gonna head out."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3674912519" "<color deepskyblue>The Key To Power</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P323750143" "Lastri's team, professional as always, managed to get you into the lost city of Oranbega without incident. The rest is up to you."
