"P2917335337" "This is hardly the time, Doctor."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3141702559" "We've found the Antikythera for you. It's time you upheld your end of the bargain."
// 3 Actor3 :
"P279626483" "You're right, of course. My apologies."
// 0 Caption :
"P328188316" "<x=0.4 y=0.3 t=0 d=5><scale 1.75>The Antikythera's primary purpose is to measure and track power emanations, specifically tuned to Pandora's Box."
// 5 Caption :
"P79716343" "<x=0.4 y=0.3 t=0 d=4><scale 1.75>I've been examining its readings ever since we left Oranbega, and what I've found is... well, it's unexpected."
// 3 Caption :
"P3832320468" "<x=0.4 y=0.3 t=0 d=3><scale 1.75>I'll need more time to study it, make sure I'm reading it correctly-"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P603340425" "<t=0 d=5.5><f E3>Doctor, I understand your desire to be certain, but we are operating on a strict timetable here..."
// 4 Actor3 :
"P2631969754" "<t=0 d=5>Well... since we departed Paragon, the signal I've been reading has only gotten weaker."
// 2 Actor2 :
"P1504599688" "<t=0 d=2><em no>Hold on, doc. Are you sayin'..."
// 4 Actor3 :
"P3159286405" "<em lecture>I'm afraid so. At this moment, Pandora's Box lies somewhere..."
// 1.5 Actor3 :
"P1925943508" "...inside Paragon City."
