// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2248153181" "You have defeated Lilitu, and retrieved the Antikythera."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P177491551" "Smooth operation as usual, boss. The more this goes on, the more it feels like we're holding all the cards. We've got Harvan and the Antikythera, and all anyone else has are bruises for getting in our way. That's the kind of M.O. I can get behind.<br><br>Still, I think we're at a point where I'm not gonna be of much use. My boys and I will keep your operations secure, but the search for this thing is way beyond our area of expertise. People like Lastri and Harvan are good at wrapping their heads around cosmic power, but I'm just not.<br><br>At the point when you start using one crazy artifact to track down another, well, that's when my brain checks out, and frankly, I kinda like it that way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
